'Initial boiling stage: a deep plain large stainless steel pot of intact black beans in darkening purple water, two bay leaves, visible full rolling boil with large bubbles and some natural pale foam, lid off. No pork, bacon, sausage or onion has been added yet. No slow cooker or pressure cooker.',
